<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Experimental results comparing <span id="S4.T1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">CSICL</span> to existing X-ICL baselines. X-ICL setting describes each method in terms of a combination of its few-shot demonstrations and instruction. <span id="S4.T1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">CSICL</span> outperforms X-ICL baselines in both target and unseen languages, yielding stable results in English. Bold and underline denote the best and the second-best results, respectively. Tgt. and Rnd. denote a target language and a random language, respectively. Asterisk indicates statistical significance against each and every baseline within the corresponding column.</figcaption>
</figure>
