<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:46.15em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You will be asked to translate a {<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p3.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">target language</span>} text. Read the following sentence and translate it into English without any explanations.
